---

<BlogLayout
  title="關於 OviNas / Nasir — 網站架設、系統資安、筆記小分享"
  description="從小對資訊抱有熱忱，專注於現代 Web 架構設計、系統資安滲透稽核、企業痛點流程自動化與實用開源工具分享。"
>
  <div class="main-content">
    <div class="container about-page-layout">
      <!-- 麵包屑導航 -->
      <nav class="breadcrumbs" aria-label="麵包屑導航">
        <a href="/">首頁</a>
        <span class="sep">/</span>
        <span class="current">關於 OviNas</span>
      </nav>

      <!-- 關於頁面主卡片 -->
      <article class="about-card-wrap">
        <!-- 頂部頭像與姓名資訊 -->
        <div class="about-header-section">
          <div class="about-avatar-box">
            <img src="/sheep-hd.png" alt="OviNas" width="110" height="110" class="about-avatar-img" />
          </div>
          <h1 class="about-main-title">OviNas <span class="about-sub-title">/ 站長專欄</span></h1>
          <div class="about-nasir-name">Nasir</div>
          <p class="about-slogan">網站架設 · 系統資安 · 筆記小分享</p>

          <div class="about-social-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/nasircy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="about-soc-btn" title="GitHub @nasircy">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M12 0c-6.626 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.302 3.438 9.8 8.207 11.387.599.111.793-.261.793-.577v-2.234c-3.338.726-4.033-1.416-4.033-1.416-.546-1.387-1.333-1.756-1.333-1.756-1.089-.745.083-.729.083-.729 1.205.084 1.839 1.237 1.839 1.237 1.07 1.834 2.807 1.304 3.492.997.107-.775.418-1.305.762-1.604-2.665-.305-5.467-1.334-5.467-5.931 0-1.311.469-2.381 1.236-3.221-.124-.303-.535-1.524.117-3.176 0 0 1.008-.322 3.301 1.23.957-.266 1.983-.399 3.003-.404 1.02.005 2.047.138 3.006.404 2.291-1.552 3.297-1.23 3.297-1.23.653 1.653.242 2.874.118 3.176.77.84 1.235 1.911 1.235 3.221 0 4.609-2.807 5.624-5.479 5.921.43.372.823 1.102.823 2.222v3.293c0 .319.192.694.801.576 4.765-1.589 8.199-6.086 8.199-11.386 0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12z"/>
              </svg>
              GitHub
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.youtube.com/@jimmypiano" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="about-soc-btn" title="YouTube @jimmypiano">
              <svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M23.498 6.186a3.016 3.016 0 0 0-2.122-2.136C19.505 3.545 12 3.545 12 3.545s-7.505 0-9.377.505A3.017 3.017 0 0 0 .502 6.186C0 8.07 0 12 0 12s0 3.93.502 5.814a3.016 3.016 0 0 0 2.122 2.136c1.871.505 9.376.505 9.376.505s7.505 0 9.377-.505a3.015 3.015 0 0 0 2.122-2.136C24 15.93 24 12 24 12s0-3.93-.502-5.814zM9.545 15.568V8.432L15.818 12l-6.273 3.568z"/>
              </svg>
              YouTube
            </a>
            <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/nasirlincy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="about-soc-btn" title="LinkedIn">
              <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor">
                <path d="M19 0h-14c-2.761 0-5 2.239-5 5v14c0 2.761 2.239 5 5 5h14c2.762 0 5-2.239 5-5v-14c0-2.761-2.238-5-5-5zm-11 19h-3v-11h3v11zm-1.5-12.268c-.966 0-1.75-.79-1.75-1.764s.784-1.764 1.75-1.764 1.75.79 1.75 1.764-.783 1.764-1.75 1.764zm13.5 12.268h-3v-5.604c0-3.368-4-3.113-4 0v5.604h-3v-11h3v1.765c1.396-2.586 7-2.777 7 2.476v6.759z"/>
              </svg>
              LinkedIn
            </a>
            <a href="https://instagram.com/hayashiiii__" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="about-soc-btn" title="Instagram">
              <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <rect x="2" y="2" width="20" height="20" rx="5" ry="5"></rect>
                <path d="M16 11.37A4 4 0 1 1 12.63 8 4 4 0 0 1 16 11.37z"></path>
                <line x1="17.5" y1="6.5" x2="17.51" y2="6.5"></line>
              </svg>
              Instagram
            </a>
            <a href="mailto:hi@nasirlin.net" class="about-soc-btn" title="Email">
              <svg width="17" height="17" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round">
                <path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"></path>
                <polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"></polyline>
              </svg>
              hi@nasirlin.net
            </a>
          </div>
        </div>

        <!-- 自我介紹故事內文 -->
        <div class="about-content-body">
          <h2 class="about-section-h2">站長理念與核心特質</h2>
          <div class="about-text-paragraphs">
            <p>
              從小對資訊領域抱有極大熱忱，歷經從 Google 查詢時代轉向現代生成式 AI 世代的浪潮。面對獲取資訊與開發技術的快速變革，我始終持續 Update 自身的資訊架構與資安專業能力。
            </p>
            <p>
              我不僅具備傳統電腦維修、伺服器架設與程式設計能力，更擅長發揮跨領域整合的想像力，深入探討企業與校園日常作業的【痛點】，將繁瑣的人工流程轉化為全自動化系統，讓原本緩慢的效率獲得大幅飛躍！
            </p>
          </div>

          <!-- 💼 1. 工作經歷與實習 (Experience) -->
          <h2 class="about-section-h2">實戰工作與校園經歷</h2>
          <div class="about-timeline-list">
            {workExperiences.map((job) => (
              <div class="about-timeline-item">
                <div class="atl-period">{job.period}</div>
                <h3 class="atl-role">{job.role}</h3>
                <div class="atl-company">{job.company}</div>
                <p class="atl-desc">{job.desc}</p>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- 🏆 2. 競賽獲獎紀錄 (Honors & Awards) -->
          <h2 class="about-section-h2">榮譽與競賽獲獎</h2>
          <div class="about-awards-grid">
            {honorsAwards.map((award) => (
              <div class="about-award-card">
                <span class="award-year">{award.year}</span>
                <h3 class="award-title">{award.title}</h3>
                <p class="award-event">{award.event}</p>
                {award.desc && <p class="award-desc">{award.desc}</p>}
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- 🚀 3. 精選開發專案 (Featured Projects) -->
          <h2 class="about-section-h2">精選自研專案作品</h2>
          <div class="about-projects-grid">
            {featuredProjects.map((p) => (
              <a href={p.link} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="about-project-card">
                <span class="proj-tag">{p.tag}</span>
                <h3 class="proj-name">
                  {p.name}
                  <svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="proj-arrow">
                    <line x1="7" y1="17" x2="17" y2="7"></line>
                    <polyline points="7 7 17 7 17 17"></polyline>
                  </svg>
                </h3>
                <p class="proj-desc">{p.desc}</p>
              </a>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- 🏅 4. 專業證照與國家認證 (Certifications & Licenses) -->
          <h2 class="about-section-h2">專業證照與國家認證清單</h2>
          <div class="about-certs-wrapper">
            {certCategories.map((cat, idx) => (
              <div class="cert-cat-block">
                <h3 class="cert-cat-title">0{idx + 1}. {cat.title}</h3>
                <ul class="cert-item-list">
                  {cat.items.map((item) => (
                    <li class="cert-item-row">
                      <span class="cert-item-name">{item.name}</span>
                      <span class="cert-item-level">{item.level}</span>
                    </li>
                  ))}
                </ul>
              </div>
            ))}
          </div>

          <!-- ✉️ 聯絡站長表單 (Google Form 串接) -->
          <div class="about-contact-box">
            <h2 class="about-section-h2" style="margin-top: 0;">聯絡站長 / 合作洽詢</h2>
            <p style="font-size: 14px; color: #64748b; margin-bottom: 1.2rem;">
              有任何專案開發、系統資安諮詢或技術合作想法？歡迎隨時填寫下方表單直接與我聯繫！
            </p>
            <form class="about-contact-form" id="aboutPageContactForm">
              <div class="form-row-2">
                <div class="form-field">
                  <label for="apName">姓名 / 稱呼 *</label>
                  <input type="text" id="apName" name="entry.57084769" placeholder="您的姓名或暱稱" required class="form-input" />
                </div>
                <div class="form-field">
                  <label for="apEmail">電子郵件 *</label>
                  <input type="email" id="apEmail" name="entry.135399445" placeholder="example@email.com" required class="form-input" />
                </div>
              </div>
              <div class="form-field">
                <label for="apMsg">訊息內容 *</label>
                <textarea id="apMsg" name="entry.1753446536" placeholder="請輸入您想討論的架構、資安或交流事項…" rows="3" required class="form-input form-textarea"></textarea>
              </div>
              <div class="form-submit-row">
                <button type="submit" id="apSubmitBtn" class="btn-about-submit">送出訊息</button>
                <span id="apStatus" class="about-form-status"></span>
              </div>
            </form>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</BlogLayout>

<style>
  .about-page-layout {
    max-width: 880px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 2.2rem 1.2rem 4.5rem;
  }

  .breadcrumbs {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 13.5px;
    color: #888888;
    margin-bottom: 2rem;
  }

  .breadcrumbs a {
    color: #555555;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .breadcrumbs a:hover {
    color: #ff6b00;
  }

  .about-card-wrap {
    background: #ffffff;
